WEBVTT

00:00:00.406 --> 00:00:06.260
In this video, you will review the homes your neighbors enter, add homes yourself, and undo a mistake.

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:07.234
We start on the map.

00:00:08.211 --> 00:00:09.885
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:12.738 --> 00:00:15.288
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:16.996 --> 00:00:17.976
Then tap Allow.

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:25.277
Now look at the top of the map, beside the search box.

00:00:25.277 --> 00:00:28.060
See your picture, or your initial, in a circle?

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:32.623
That is your account menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:32.623 --> 00:00:33.324
Tap it.

00:00:34.875 --> 00:00:36.838
In the menu, tap Your contests.

00:00:38.411 --> 00:00:42.497
That is where the contests you run, and the homes you entered, live.

00:00:42.497 --> 00:00:44.380
Tap Mine, your personal page.

00:00:45.975 --> 00:00:48.084
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:00:49.892 --> 00:00:51.086
Now tap Entries.

00:00:52.827 --> 00:00:55.355
Nothing goes on the map until you approve it.

00:00:56.203 --> 00:01:00.204
At the top is Add homes yourself, for homes you already know about.

00:01:00.204 --> 00:01:01.238
Tap it to open.

00:01:02.871 --> 00:01:06.506
Paste one address per line, with a name after a bar, if you like.

00:01:07.354 --> 00:01:08.916
Then tap Check addresses.

00:01:10.815 --> 00:01:12.181
Nothing is added yet.

00:01:13.057 --> 00:01:14.568
Each line is looked up.

00:01:14.568 --> 00:01:15.850
Found means ready.

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:17.645
Not found means a typo.

00:01:17.645 --> 00:01:19.672
Already in means it is in your contest.

00:01:20.505 --> 00:01:24.461
Tick the box to confirm the residents agreed to have their address shown.

00:01:26.072 --> 00:01:27.571
Then tap Add 3 homes.

00:01:30.347 --> 00:01:34.489
The new homes are on the map and the ballot, tagged Added by organizer.

00:01:36.801 --> 00:01:38.320
Added one by mistake?

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:40.699
Tap Remove, then tap again to confirm.

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:43.071
Tap again.

00:01:45.136 --> 00:01:47.306
Homes your neighbors enter wait for you.

00:01:47.306 --> 00:01:49.149
If one looks right, tap Approve.

00:01:50.789 --> 00:01:53.656
It joins the contest, and the neighbor is emailed.

00:01:54.525 --> 00:01:56.645
If one does not belong, tap Decline.

00:01:58.281 --> 00:02:00.634
A kind note helps the neighbor try again.

00:02:00.634 --> 00:02:02.196
Then tap Decline entry.

00:02:04.984 --> 00:02:06.109
Changed your mind?

00:02:06.109 --> 00:02:07.422
Tap Undo decline.

00:02:09.233 --> 00:02:11.600
Next up: Add your city's homes yourself.
